# Through the Quicksand Caves: a helper, area 2. Main (current, status 0) and eve (the mission completed,
# The Chamber of Oracles current) both get the menu (bit 1) and enter area 2 (option 2). The three
# Centurio V-III of area 2 (+3 to +5) die: 32001 to both (eve's with a seventh param, 1). Eve's finish
# changes nothing; main's is Through the Quicksand Caves' (mission.zilart.through_the_quicksand_caves):
# it completes the mission (The Chamber of Oracles current).
lists ChamberOfOracles/SC_Entrance/onTrigger ChamberOfOracles/SC_Entrance/onTrade ChamberOfOracles/onEventUpdate/32000 ChamberOfOracles/onEventFinish/32000 ChamberOfOracles/onEventFinish/32001 ChamberOfOracles/onEventFinish/32002 ChamberOfOracles/Shimmering_Circle/onTrigger
char zone=ChamberOfOracles pos=-218.6,-1.9,23.0 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
char eve zone=ChamberOfOracles pos=-218.6,-1.9,23.0 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
mission Zilart ThroughTheQuicksandCaves current
eve: mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
eve: mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
eve: mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
eve: mission Soa Abomination current
eve: mission Zilart ThroughTheQuicksandCaves completed
eve: mission Zilart TheChamberOfOracles current
login
eve: login
invite eve
eve: accept
trigger SC_Entrance
update 32000 option=2                   # index 0, area 2: entered
finish
eve: trigger SC_Entrance
eve: update 32000 option=2
eve: finish
tick 2000
kill CENTURIO_V_III+3
kill CENTURIO_V_III+4
kill CENTURIO_V_III+5                   # all three dead: won, 32001 to both
eve: finish                             # eve (not current): nothing
finish                                  # main: the mission's 32001, completed
